---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="About">
  <section class="about">
    <Portrait variant="about" />
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>{site.displayName}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{site.positioning}</p>
      <p>
        I got started in Universal’s parking department, trying to make repetitive work easier for the people doing it. I
        began with document templates and formulas, moved on to macros, then learned Python when I needed to connect systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        A manager there connected me with a mentor, and I changed my studies to software development. When B-Stock reached
        out about an eCommerce listing role, I was paired with the automation team I’d eventually join.
      </p>
      <p>
        These days I lead Process Automation at B-Stock, working across teams to help the company scale without scaling the
        busywork. My favorite result so far is a logistics invoicing process that went from 40+ hours a week to about two. The
        part I care about is the sigh of relief when a workload feels manageable and people can give their attention to work
        that needs their judgment.
      </p>
      <p>
        Off the clock I solve chess puzzles, play rapid, and race someone to the finish in Crossmath’s battle mode. Otherwise
        I’m traveling with my wife, Andrea, trying new food and finding a good trail. And yes, I still selfishly enjoy chasing
        the next interesting problem.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
